	"notes": "The flagship. Five roads through one problem, all inside one OR group, so the journal reads 'settled another way' for the four the player did not walk. speak_victims, find_camp and killed_the_crew all pre-complete against the world, so a player who cleared the camp before anyone asked gets the whole quest handed back finished the moment the elder offers it. joined_the_crew and took_the_chair are failures from Mill Brook's point of view and completions from the player's - the turn-in dialogue carries the difference, and taking the chair starts the ongoing-effects ticker."
